Monolayer Boron Nitride - Mean Field
====================================

In this directory, we will perform all the mean-field calculations for
BerkeleyGW. 


Instructions
------------

  1. First, run the script ``./01-link_files.sh``. It will create links for the
     charge density, pseudopotentials, exchange-correlation matrix elements, 
     and WFN files.
 
  2. Go to each directory in the numeric order they appear and follow the instructions
     in the README.
